}

<div class="wrapper">
    <div class="gambo-Breadcrumb">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-12">
                    <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
                        <ol class="breadcrumb">
                            <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                            <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">About Us</li>
                        </ol>
                    </nav>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="life-gambo">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="default-title left-text">
                        <h2>About Us</h2>
                        <p>Fast, Fresh & Delivered to Your Door</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-content">
                        <p>
                            Welcome to our <strong>Online Food Ordering System</strong>, a modern and user-friendly platform designed to make food ordering simple, fast, and convenient. Our website allows customers to explore a wide variety of delicious food items, add them to their cart, and place orders easily from the comfort of their home.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            In today’s busy lifestyle, people need quick and reliable services. That’s why our system is built with a smooth interface, secure checkout process, and responsive design to ensure a seamless experience on both desktop and mobile devices.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            We focus on providing clear pricing, easy menu browsing, quantity selection, multiple payment options, and fast order processing. Our mission is to deliver a convenient, efficient, and satisfying food ordering experience by combining technology with quality service.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            We are committed to continuously improving our platform to provide the best online food ordering experience for our valued customers.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="about-img">
                        <img src="~/assets/FoodManagementSystemWebsite_assets/images/About.gif" style="background-color:red;" />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
